ssage","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Twitterにも書いたけど Julia にはメソッドのドット記法が欲しい","ts":"1618677149.230100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zst"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc0874e4-b1bc-47d2-95db-19aa989dce82","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"Julia自体の性能はかなり良さそうに見えるんですけど、Pythonに取って代わるには色々利便性向上しないと難しそうな気がしてます","ts":"1618677051.230000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qQcD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7d52ac0-8e98-48a6-a585-6ed353618ece","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Julia、numpy に慣れてしまった身としては多次元配列の扱いがあまり直感的でないのがネック。\nnumpy は dim が3以上になっても直感が働きやすいのですが、Julia だとよく分からなくなっちゃうんですよね…","ts":"1618675542.228800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"nanido","count":1,"users":["U9GUS1S0G"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w6U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce548205-c0bf-46b8-9dfb-5c9f0576dcea","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"私も数値計算にしか使ってないので、他の用途に関してはどうなんでしょうね。\n微分方程式を解くための積分器の出来が異様によいので一部の人には便利です。","ts":"1618673758.226900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sxL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2a87780-31df-476c-acea-da5707225ca5","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"ですね。一ヶ月も経ってないくらいです。","ts":"1618673614.225000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Kuio"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b650c7a-6f97-479f-9736-4ac05fe14a6a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"お、それは嬉しい。Julia は新しいぶん進化も速いのが良いところですね（v1.6 もつい先日リリースされたばかりのはず）。","ts":"1618673519.224300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AmfoP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aca3aa9a-e42a-4d48-8e5d-8bc828ee6094","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"v1.6.0 からずいぶん初動もよくなりました。あくまで以前よりはですが。","ts":"1618673346.223100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MeX7C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62a4e56e-9c04-4af1-986d-3b820164edb0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"最初っから機械語まで落としていた気がする","ts":"1618673315.222300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eUR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"005b1890-bc4c-41a7-8170-5404a7520d77","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"LLVMでごりごりコンパイルしてますからね","ts":"1618673290.221400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/lYd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8b2957b-d195-479d-992d-8fb6b3867ed0","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"昔少し触ったときの経験からすると、Julia は JIT コンパイルによって実行が速い代わりに、初動が遅いんですよね（おそらくコンパイル処理のため？）。モジュール読み込みとか結構時間がかかったりしますし、REPL でちょっとした文を実行するときもよく待たされてました（2回目からは高速になる）。今はそのへん改善されてるのかな…？","ts":"1618673266.220900","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1618673282.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LOCn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7db7bf27-aa77-47e1-9e87-cd44e0bec431","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"汎用のプログラミング言語として使うこともできるはずです。\n設計思想は明らかに科学技術計算用途を強く意識していますね。なにせ公式ドキュメントの Introduction の一番最初が \"Scientific computing has traditionally required ...\" で始まりますから。\n\n\u0026gt; Julia provides ease and expressiveness for high-level numerical computing, in the same way as languages such as R, MATLAB, and Python, but also supports general programming. To achieve this, Julia builds upon the lineage of mathematical programming languages, but also borrows much from popular dynamic languages, including \u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lisp_(programming_language)|Lisp\u003e, \u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perl_(programming_language)|Perl\u003e, \u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Python_(programming_language)|Python\u003e, \u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lua_(programming_language)|Lua\u003e, and \u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ruby_(programming_language)|Ruby\u003e.\nとのことです","ts":"1618673102.218500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4ITt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe521699-b9c1-449f-b91b-4af154a5b9b5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"どうでしょう、ちょっと触った感じ汎用のプログラミング言語に見えたので不思議だったんですよね","ts":"1618672926.217100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+Mz3S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64c1abc9-2f11-4d02-b6fe-32f0e229ea25","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"実際、現状だと科学技術計算のための言語って感じがしますね。科学技術計算以外の用途で Julia 使ってる人いるのかな？","ts":"1618672862.216700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iXnW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0d0a23c-af75-4ee4-93f5-b0e8f555c428","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Julia面白そうだけど計算の分野でしか名前聞かない","ts":"1618672502.214400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4EL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5de6fee-2e45-479f-9006-64a1cb5817bb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003chttp://hi-masai.blogspot.com/2021/04/julia.html\u003e","ts":"1618672476.213700","attachments":[{"fallback":"どうして Julia を作ったか","id":1,"title":"どうして Julia を作ったか","title_link":"http://hi-masai.blogspot.com/2021/04/julia.html","text":"プログラミング言語「Julia」開発者さんの文章がとても好きなので、 雰囲気重視で訳しました 。 結構意訳です 。 原典：\u003chttps://julialang.org/blog/2012/02/why-we-created-julia/\u003e ======================...","blocks":null,"service_name":"hi-masai.blogspot.com","service_icon":"http://hi-masai.blogspot.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"http://hi-masai.blogspot.com/2021/04/julia.html","origin